      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "SCHEDULE OF REASONS",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "0471e83c1ea18086cfb6b3ff51da6f22b0efee337f10315b2593f782297ccb84-p2-b7",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "1. On 30 December 2025, the Defendant's Renewed Application for Permission to Appeal was",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "0471e83c1ea18086cfb6b3ff51da6f22b0efee337f10315b2593f782297ccb84-p2-b8",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "dismissed and the Defendant was ordered to pay the Claimant's costs of the Renewed Application to",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "0471e83c1ea18086cfb6b3ff51da6f22b0efee337f10315b2593f782297ccb84-p2-b9",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "be assessed on the standard basis. Directions were made for the service of a Statement of Costs and",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "0471e83c1ea18086cfb6b3ff51da6f22b0efee337f10315b2593f782297ccb84-p2-b10",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "for the exchange of submissions on the subject on the basis that the costs would be assessed by a",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "0471e83c1ea18086cfb6b3ff51da6f22b0efee337f10315b2593f782297ccb84-p2-b11",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "process of immediate assessment on the papers.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "0471e83c1ea18086cfb6b3ff51da6f22b0efee337f10315b2593f782297ccb84-p2-b12",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "2. The Claimant's Statement of Costs claims a total of AED76,750.00. The Statement sets out the",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "0471e83c1ea18086cfb6b3ff51da6f22b0efee337f10315b2593f782297ccb84-p2-b13",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "hourly rates claimed in respect of each fee earner providing services to the Claimant. Those rates are",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "0471e83c1ea18086cfb6b3ff51da6f22b0efee337f10315b2593f782297ccb84-p2-b14",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "well within the rates promulgated in the currently applicable Registrar's Direction.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "0471e83c1ea18086cfb6b3ff51da6f22b0efee337f10315b2593f782297ccb84-p2-b15",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "3. The work required to be done in response to the Renewed Application was essentially limited to the",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "0471e83c1ea18086cfb6b3ff51da6f22b0efee337f10315b2593f782297ccb84-p2-b16",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "preparation and filing of a skeleton argument in opposition to the Application, together with the",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "0471e83c1ea18086cfb6b3ff51da6f22b0efee337f10315b2593f782297ccb84-p2-b17",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "preparation of the Statement of Costs. The amount claimed is made of approximately 34 hours spent",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "0471e83c1ea18086cfb6b3ff51da6f22b0efee337f10315b2593f782297ccb84-p2-b18",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "in preparation of the skeleton, and three hours in attendances upon the client.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "0471e83c1ea18086cfb6b3ff51da6f22b0efee337f10315b2593f782297ccb84-p2-b19",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "4. The Defendant submits that the costs claimed are unreasonable and disproportionate because:",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "0471e83c1ea18086cfb6b3ff51da6f22b0efee337f10315b2593f782297ccb84-p2-b20",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "•The grounds of appeal were the same as the grounds advanced in the Initial Application for",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "0471e83c1ea18086cfb6b3ff51da6f22b0efee337f10315b2593f782297ccb84-p2-b21",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "permission to appeal;",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "0471e83c1ea18086cfb6b3ff51da6f22b0efee337f10315b2593f782297ccb84-p2-b22",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "The skeleton served in opposition to the Renewed Application drew heavily upon the skeleton",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "0471e83c1ea18086cfb6b3ff51da6f22b0efee337f10315b2593f782297ccb84-p2-b23",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "served in opposition to the Initial Application and incorporated substantial portions of the first",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "0471e83c1ea18086cfb6b3ff51da6f22b0efee337f10315b2593f782297ccb84-p2-b24",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "skeleton by reference;",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "0471e83c1ea18086cfb6b3ff51da6f22b0efee337f10315b2593f782297ccb84-p2-b25",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "•The second skeleton is shorter than the first; and",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "0471e83c1ea18086cfb6b3ff51da6f22b0efee337f10315b2593f782297ccb84-p2-b26",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "The substantial analytical and drafting work had already been completed in preparation of the",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "0471e83c1ea18086cfb6b3ff51da6f22b0efee337f10315b2593f782297ccb84-p2-b27",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "first skeleton.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "0471e83c1ea18086cfb6b3ff51da6f22b0efee337f10315b2593f782297ccb84-p2-b28",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "5. The Defendant further contends that client attendances of three hours were unnecessary, given that",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "0471e83c1ea18086cfb6b3ff51da6f22b0efee337f10315b2593f782297ccb84-p2-b29",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "the issues raised in the Renewed Application were unchanged from the Initial Application.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "0471e83c1ea18086cfb6b3ff51da6f22b0efee337f10315b2593f782297ccb84-p2-b30",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "6. There is force in the Defendant's submissions. A total of 34 hours is an excessive amount of time for",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "0471e83c1ea18086cfb6b3ff51da6f22b0efee337f10315b2593f782297ccb84-p2-b31",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "the preparation of a skeleton which dealt with substantially the same issues as a skeleton which had",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "0471e83c1ea18086cfb6b3ff51da6f22b0efee337f10315b2593f782297ccb84-p2-b32",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "been prepared and filed in opposition to the Initial Application.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "0471e83c1ea18086cfb6b3ff51da6f22b0efee337f10315b2593f782297ccb84-p2-b33",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "7. A reasonable amount proportionate to the work involved is AED 44,000.00 (approximately USD",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "0471e83c1ea18086cfb6b3ff51da6f22b0efee337f10315b2593f782297ccb84-p2-b34",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "12,000) and the Claimant's costs will be assessed in that amount.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    }
